50:[$FAE16B]Etera[$ffffff]: The people of Citland are grateful for being saved from the oppression of the Grand Inquisition.
51:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Most of the credit is mine:5_00150. However, I agree with my wife. Your appearance in the tunnels helped us greatly.
52:[$FAE16B]Etera[$ffffff]: What are your plans next?
53:Malcolm: Dyron has a plan to defeat Kregor, and perhaps "The Guest," and reclaim Valtaria.
54:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Kregor is ruthless, and Valtaria is impregnable. I heard Dyron helped you with Truth's armor back then. 55:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: There's a single gate into the city, which is impassable anyway.
56:Malcolm: That's not entirely true.
57:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Enlighten us, all-wise lord:5_00157
58:Malcolm: Drein knows secret passages to the capital. We'll get there easily, especially since he's the only one who knows about them:5_00150
59:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: He's not the only one.
60:Malcolm: Then there are two people who know another entrance:5_00157. Strange that I don't know about it:5_00155
61:[$FAE16B]Etera[$ffffff]: Surprise attack. 
62:Malcolm: Of course:5_00134. We'll need troops, lots of them:5_00150. Ideally, as soon as possible.
63:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: I understand we have to recruit them too. Who's gathering them besides us?
64:Malcolm: I'm sure Drein and Ethyria are already recruiting. Ratling too, I hope.
65:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Once we gather the troops, we'll light the signal tower and sail out of Citland:5_00150. Messenger! Send these letters to King Drein, Ratling in the Garrison, Baron Ari in the Circlet Stronghold, and the Queen Ethyria in Andaro. They should be ready to march. In three days, we'll set out for Valtaria. 
66:Malcolm: We'll go to Andaro. We'll keep an eye on ourselves with telescopes just in case.
67:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: When the time comes, we'll go to Nuvea, we'll meet there.
68:Malcolm: Yes, all together:5_00150
69:[$FAE16B]Etera[$ffffff]: Wait a moment, because... You didn't mention Hanrain.
70:Malcolm: Hanrain no longer exists:5_00137. Our "Guest" had a real fun stealing Dyron's armor.
71:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Exactly... Where is King Dyron?? Did he cower in fear and run away? When he's needed, he goes to the Fortune Teller:5_00157. 
72:Malcolm: Listen, raspberry-tomato guy:5_00146. We survived last time because Dyron returned in time with a legendary artifact. At least I believe he'll come back. As long as he never lets us down:5_00145
73:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: :5_00144
74:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: I'd be more convinced if he were here with us:5_00154
75:Malcolm: He's looking for a solution, just like any of us:5_00145. As long as he's alive, there's always some hope.
76:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: I hope you're right:5_00157
77:[$FAE16B]Etera[$ffffff]: What are you planning?
78:Malcolm: We're going to Andaro to meet with Queen Ethyria and my friend Eryth. We'll see what stage their military training is at.
79:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Huh. A good plan is key:5_00132
80:Malcolm: Of course:5_00134